      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this fantastic four-bedroom, mid terrace red brick period property Ideally located on Philipsburgh Avenue in Fairview, Dublin 3.\nPhilipsburgh Avenue enjoys a superb location with an excellent range of amenities right on its doorstep. Residents are within walking distance of a variety of shops, supermarkets, cafes, restaurants, boutiques, salons and schools, while Fairview Park, Westwood Fitness Centre and Clontarf Road DART Station are all close by. The area is also well served by numerous bus routes, including the 123 bus just moments away, providing excellent connectivity to the city centre, IFSC, East Point Business Park and Dublin's vibrant Docklands. For those who enjoy the outdoors, Clontarf's scenic seafront promenade and St Anne's Park are both within easy reach. Beaumont Hospital, the Mater Hospital, Dublin Airport, and the M1 and M50 motorways are all easily accessible, making this an exceptionally convenient and well-connected location.\nBright and spacious internal living accommodation of c. 181 sqm comprises of a storm porch, inviting entrance hallway, two large reception rooms with feature fireplace, dining room, extended kitchen and downstairs shower room all located downstairs. Upstairs hosts 3 well-proportioned bedrooms and a fully tiled bathroom with shower. The attic is in use a master bedroom. To the rear there is a generous westerly facing rear garden. This superb family home comes to the market in need of modernisation but has massive potential for any buyer to come in and put their own stamp on the property and is sure to appeal to anyone seeking to live in a well-established and highly convenient location, just moments from an excellent range of local amenities. An opportunity not to be missed: call Ray Cooke Auctioneers on 086 0469458 or 01 6995050 today for further information or to arrange viewing!!\n\n\nAdditional Features:\n\n<ul>\n <li>c. 181 sq.m</li>\n <li>BER: F</li>\n <li>4/5 bedroom | 2 Bathrooms</li>\n <li>Mid Terrace</li>\n <li>Period home</li>\n <li>Red brick façade</li>\n <li>Extended to rear</li>\n <li>Light filled interior</li>\n <li>High Ceilings</li>\n <li>Well-proportioned accommodation throughout</li>\n <li>Westerly facing rear garden</li>\n <li>On street parking to the front</li>\n <li>Mature and highly sought-after location</li>\n <li>Excellent transport links nearby</li>\n <li>Clontarf DART station close by</li>\n <li>Excellent primary and secondary schools close by</li>\n <li>Ideal for first-time buyers, families upsizing and investors alike</li>\n <li>Early Viewing is highly advised</li>\n</ul>"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Negotiator",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "Sales Team 2"
      }
